@baseUrl = https://localhost:7280

### Download the sample PDF report
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/sample
Accept: application/pdf

### Flat sales report: portrait, date and currency formatting, totals
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/flat
Accept: application/pdf

### Grouped sales report: region sections and totals
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/grouped
Accept: application/pdf

### Styled sales report: links, highlights, widths, hidden columns
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/styled
Accept: application/pdf

### Currency summary: demo-only spell-out text
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/summary
Accept: application/pdf

###
